<title>USA: Noble unit acquires rights in China.</title>
<headline>Noble unit acquires rights in China.</headline>
<dateline>ARDMORE, Okla. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noble Affiliates Inc said an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary has an agreement to acquire exploration and development rights in China.</p>
<p>The subsidiary, Energy Development Corp (China) Inc, is acquiring the rights in Cheng Zi Kou block in Bo Hai Bay, offshore China, from Chinese National Petroleum Corp.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The Cheng Zi Kou block encompasses about 117,000 acres in an area adjacent to the Shengli oil field in China.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
